2	1	광고물 제작 및 게시 용역계약서 예시		<h1 class="ql-align-center"><strong style="color: black;">광고물&nbsp;제작&nbsp;및&nbsp;게시&nbsp;용역계약서</strong><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;</span></h1><p class="ql-align-right"></p><p class="ql-align-justify"><strong>밴스드</strong>&nbsp;<span style="color: black;">(이하&nbsp;“회사”라&nbsp;한다)</span>와&nbsp;<span style="color: rgb(101, 117, 139); background-color: rgb(249, 250, 251);">{{인플루언서명}}</span><span style="color: black;">(이하”파트너”라&nbsp;한다)은,&nbsp;광고물을&nbsp;제작·게시하는&nbsp;용역을&nbsp;수행함에&nbsp;있어&nbsp;양&nbsp;당사자의&nbsp;권리와&nbsp;의무를&nbsp;명확히&nbsp;하고,&nbsp;상호&nbsp;신뢰를&nbsp;바탕으로&nbsp;원활한&nbsp;업무&nbsp;수행을&nbsp;도모하기&nbsp;위하여&nbsp;본&nbsp;광고물&nbsp;제작&nbsp;및&nbsp;게시&nbsp;용역계약서(이하&nbsp;“본&nbsp;계약”이라&nbsp;한다)를&nbsp;체결한다.</span></p><p><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><strong style="color: black;">제1조&nbsp;[목적]</strong></p><p><span style="color: black;">본&nbsp;계약은&nbsp;“</span>밴스드<span style="color: black;">”</span>에서&nbsp;대행<span style="color: black;">하는&nbsp;</span>광고와<span style="color: black;">&nbsp;관련하여&nbsp;“</span>밴스드<span style="color: black;">”</span>와<span style="color: black;">&nbsp;“파트너”&nbsp;간의&nbsp;서비스&nbsp;제휴를&nbsp;명확하게&nbsp;하고&nbsp;양&nbsp;당사자&nbsp;간의&nbsp;의무와&nbsp;권리를&nbsp;규정함에&nbsp;그&nbsp;목적이&nbsp;있다.</span></p><p></p><p><strong style="color: black;">제2조&nbsp;[용어의&nbsp;정의]</strong></p><ol><li><span style="color: black;">본&nbsp;계약서에서&nbsp;사용하는&nbsp;용어는&nbsp;아래&nbsp;각&nbsp;호와&nbsp;같은&nbsp;의미를&nbsp;가진다.&nbsp;</span></li></ol><p><span style="color: black;">A.&nbsp;“회사”라&nbsp;함은&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약의&nbsp;주체인&nbsp;“</span>밴스드<span style="color: black;">”</span>를<span style="color: black;">&nbsp;말한다.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="color: black;">B.&nbsp;“파트너”라&nbsp;함은&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약에&nbsp;따라&nbsp;“회사”가&nbsp;진행하는&nbsp;광고를&nbsp;위해&nbsp;“회사”와&nbsp;업무제휴를&nbsp;한&nbsp;파트너를&nbsp;말한다.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="color: black;">C.&nbsp;“광고물”이라&nbsp;함은&nbsp;“파트너”가&nbsp;“회사”와&nbsp;논의한&nbsp;내용&nbsp;바탕으로&nbsp;제작한&nbsp;홍보를&nbsp;위한&nbsp;광고&nbsp;영상&nbsp;콘텐츠를&nbsp;말한다.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="color: black;">D.&nbsp;“광고비”라&nbsp;함은&nbsp;“파트너”가&nbsp;“회사”</span>가&nbsp;진행하는&nbsp;광고&nbsp;캠페인에&nbsp;대한&nbsp;<span style="color: black;">홍보&nbsp;활동을&nbsp;한&nbsp;것에&nbsp;대해&nbsp;“회사”가&nbsp;“파트너”에&nbsp;지급하는&nbsp;비용을&nbsp;말한다.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="color: black;">E.&nbsp;“계약&nbsp;기간”이라&nbsp;함은&nbsp;“회사”와&nbsp;“파트너”가&nbsp;업무&nbsp;제휴를&nbsp;맺는&nbsp;기간을&nbsp;의미한다.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="color: black;">F.&nbsp;“클라이언트”란&nbsp;본&nbsp;광고의&nbsp;대상이&nbsp;되는&nbsp;“VOYE&nbsp;GLOBAL&nbsp;CONNECTIVITY&nbsp;LTD”를&nbsp;말한다.</span></p><ol><li><span style="color: black;">제1항에서&nbsp;별도로&nbsp;정의되지&nbsp;않은&nbsp;용어는&nbsp;관련&nbsp;법령&nbsp;및&nbsp;상관례에&nbsp;따라&nbsp;해석한다.&nbsp;</span></li></ol><p></p><p><strong style="color: black;">제3조&nbsp;[업무&nbsp;내용]</strong></p><ol><li><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;“파트너”가&nbsp;만든&nbsp;“광고물”에&nbsp;대해&nbsp;“회사”는&nbsp;“광고비”를&nbsp;지급하기로&nbsp;한다.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">상기&nbsp;“광고비”에는&nbsp;광고물의&nbsp;제작&nbsp;및&nbsp;게시에&nbsp;대한&nbsp;대가와&nbsp;함께,&nbsp;게시일로부터&nbsp;</span><strong style="color: black; background-color: yellow;">3개월간의&nbsp;2차&nbsp;활용&nbsp;라이선스</strong><span style="color: black;">를&nbsp;포함한다.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">“파트너”는&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약에&nbsp;따라&nbsp;“회사”가&nbsp;제공한&nbsp;콘텐츠&nbsp;가이드라인에&nbsp;따라&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">광고물(영상&nbsp;1편)을&nbsp;제작하고,&nbsp;합의된&nbsp;일정&nbsp;내에&nbsp;자신의&nbsp;채널에&nbsp;게시한다.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;“회사”는&nbsp;“파트너”가&nbsp;“회사”의&nbsp;사전&nbsp;승인&nbsp;및&nbsp;검수를&nbsp;완료하고,&nbsp;합의된&nbsp;일정&nbsp;내에&nbsp;광고물을&nbsp;게시한&nbsp;것을&nbsp;확인한&nbsp;후,&nbsp;영업일&nbsp;기준&nbsp;15일&nbsp;이내에&nbsp;광고비&nbsp;</span><strong style="color: black; background-color: yellow;">4,500,00</strong><strong style="background-color: yellow;">0</strong><strong style="background-color: yellow; color: black;">원(VAT&nbsp;별도)</strong><span style="color: black;">을&nbsp;지급한다.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">“파트너”는&nbsp;제4항에&nbsp;따른&nbsp;광고비의&nbsp;지급을&nbsp;위하여,&nbsp;관련&nbsp;법령에&nbsp;따라&nbsp;세금계산서를&nbsp;“회사”에게&nbsp;발행한다.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">제</span>1<span style="color: black;">항에&nbsp;따른&nbsp;대가를&nbsp;다음&nbsp;계좌&nbsp;정보로&nbsp;지급한다.</span></li></ol><ul><li>은행명&nbsp;:&nbsp;</li><li>계좌번호&nbsp;:</li><li>예금주명&nbsp;:</li></ul><ol><li><span style="color: black;">본&nbsp;계약은&nbsp;독립된&nbsp;당사자&nbsp;간에&nbsp;체결하는&nbsp;계약으로&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약에&nbsp;따른&nbsp;업무제휴로&nbsp;인하여&nbsp;양&nbsp;당사자&nbsp;간에&nbsp;대리관계나&nbsp;고용관계&nbsp;등이&nbsp;발생하지&nbsp;아니한다.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">본&nbsp;계약에&nbsp;따라&nbsp;“파트너”가&nbsp;제작한&nbsp;“광고물”의&nbsp;저작권은&nbsp;원칙적으로&nbsp;“파트너”에게&nbsp;귀속되며,&nbsp;“회사”는&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약에서&nbsp;정한&nbsp;목적과&nbsp;범위&nbsp;내에서&nbsp;해당&nbsp;광고물을&nbsp;사용한다.</span></li></ol><p></p><p><strong style="color: black;">제4조&nbsp;[“회사”의&nbsp;권리와&nbsp;의무]&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><ol><li><span style="color: black;">“회사”는&nbsp;“파트너”가&nbsp;“회사”를&nbsp;홍보하기&nbsp;위해&nbsp;필요한&nbsp;모든&nbsp;관련&nbsp;정보를&nbsp;사전에&nbsp;합의된&nbsp;수준으로&nbsp;정확하게&nbsp;제공한다.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">제3조&nbsp;</span>1<span style="color: black;">항에&nbsp;따라&nbsp;</span>광고비<span style="color: black;">를&nbsp;“파트너”에게&nbsp;지급하여야&nbsp;한다.&nbsp;</span></li></ol><p></p><p><strong style="color: black;">제5조&nbsp;[“파트너”의&nbsp;권리와&nbsp;의무]&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><ol><li><span style="color: black;">“파트너”는&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약에&nbsp;따른&nbsp;제휴&nbsp;업무&nbsp;수행에&nbsp;대한&nbsp;내역을&nbsp;“회사”와&nbsp;별도로&nbsp;합의한&nbsp;바에&nbsp;따라&nbsp;“회사”에&nbsp;제공하여야&nbsp;한다.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">“파트너”는&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약에&nbsp;따른&nbsp;의무를&nbsp;이행하기&nbsp;위하여&nbsp;필요한&nbsp;범위&nbsp;내에서만&nbsp;“회사”의&nbsp;상표,&nbsp;&nbsp;브랜드&nbsp;및&nbsp;로고&nbsp;등을&nbsp;사용할&nbsp;수&nbsp;있고,&nbsp;이&nbsp;외의&nbsp;다른&nbsp;목적으로&nbsp;사용할&nbsp;수&nbsp;없다.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">“파트너”는&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약에&nbsp;따른&nbsp;의무를&nbsp;이행함에&nbsp;있어&nbsp;관련&nbsp;법령&nbsp;및&nbsp;규정을&nbsp;준수하여야&nbsp;한다.&nbsp;</span></li></ol><p></p><p><strong style="color: black;">제6조&nbsp;[계약의&nbsp;해제&nbsp;또는&nbsp;해지]&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><ol><li><span style="color: black;">각&nbsp;당사자는&nbsp;상대방에게&nbsp;아래&nbsp;각&nbsp;호의&nbsp;사유&nbsp;중&nbsp;하나가&nbsp;발생한&nbsp;경우,&nbsp;상대방에게&nbsp;구두&nbsp;혹은&nbsp;서면으로&nbsp;통지하여&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약을&nbsp;해제&nbsp;또는&nbsp;해지할&nbsp;수&nbsp;있다.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li></ol><ul><li><span style="color: black;">A.&nbsp;상대방이&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약의&nbsp;각&nbsp;조항을&nbsp;위반하거나&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약&nbsp;상의&nbsp;의무를&nbsp;이행하지&nbsp;아니한&nbsp;때&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">B.&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약에서&nbsp;정한&nbsp;업무를&nbsp;이행하기&nbsp;위해서&nbsp;정부의&nbsp;인∙허가&nbsp;또는&nbsp;등록∙신고&nbsp;등이&nbsp;필요한&nbsp;것으로&nbsp;법률&nbsp;또는&nbsp;규정이&nbsp;제정&nbsp;또는&nbsp;개정되는&nbsp;경우&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">C.&nbsp;상대방의&nbsp;중요&nbsp;자산에&nbsp;대한&nbsp;가압류∙가처분이&nbsp;있었거나&nbsp;상대방이&nbsp;회생&nbsp;또는&nbsp;파산을&nbsp;신청하는&nbsp;경우&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">D.&nbsp;기타&nbsp;상대방이&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약의&nbsp;이행이&nbsp;불가능하다고&nbsp;판단할&nbsp;합리적인&nbsp;사유가&nbsp;있는&nbsp;경우&nbsp;</span></li></ul><ol><li><span style="color: black;">제1항에&nbsp;따른&nbsp;계약의&nbsp;해제&nbsp;또는&nbsp;해지는&nbsp;해제&nbsp;또는&nbsp;해지&nbsp;사유를&nbsp;명확히&nbsp;기재한&nbsp;서면에&nbsp;의해&nbsp;통지하며,&nbsp;그&nbsp;통지가&nbsp;상대방에게&nbsp;도달한&nbsp;뒤에&nbsp;해제&nbsp;또는&nbsp;해지의&nbsp;효력이&nbsp;발생한다.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">본&nbsp;조에&nbsp;따른&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약의&nbsp;해제&nbsp;또는&nbsp;해지는&nbsp;각&nbsp;당사자의&nbsp;상대방에&nbsp;대한&nbsp;손해배상청구에&nbsp;영향을&nbsp;미치지&nbsp;아니한다.&nbsp;</span></li></ol><p><strong style="color: black;">제7조&nbsp;[동종업계&nbsp;홍보&nbsp;배제]&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><ol><li><span style="color: black;">“파트너”는&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약에&nbsp;따른&nbsp;광고물의&nbsp;최초&nbsp;게시일로부터&nbsp;3개월간,&nbsp;“회사”&nbsp;및&nbsp;“클라이언트”와&nbsp;사전&nbsp;서면&nbsp;합의&nbsp;없이&nbsp;동종업계의&nbsp;상품&nbsp;또는&nbsp;서비스에&nbsp;대한&nbsp;광고,&nbsp;홍보,&nbsp;협찬&nbsp;콘텐츠를&nbsp;제작·게시하거나&nbsp;이에&nbsp;관여하여서는&nbsp;아니&nbsp;된다.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">본&nbsp;조에서&nbsp;말하는&nbsp;“동종업계”란&nbsp;eSIM,&nbsp;로밍,&nbsp;유심(USIM)&nbsp;및&nbsp;이에&nbsp;준하는&nbsp;해외&nbsp;통신&nbsp;서비스&nbsp;관련&nbsp;회사를&nbsp;의미한다.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">본&nbsp;조의&nbsp;홍보&nbsp;배제&nbsp;의무는&nbsp;파트너의&nbsp;</span><strong style="color: black; background-color: yellow;">인스타그램&nbsp;채널을</strong><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;통한&nbsp;유료·무상&nbsp;콘텐츠,&nbsp;협찬,&nbsp;제휴&nbsp;게시물,&nbsp;링크&nbsp;삽입,&nbsp;할인&nbsp;코드&nbsp;제공&nbsp;등&nbsp;모든&nbsp;형태의&nbsp;홍보&nbsp;행위를&nbsp;포함한다.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">본&nbsp;조의&nbsp;의무를&nbsp;위반하여&nbsp;“파트너”가&nbsp;동종업계&nbsp;홍보를&nbsp;진행한&nbsp;경우,&nbsp;“회사”는&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약을&nbsp;즉시&nbsp;해지할&nbsp;수&nbsp;있으며,&nbsp;이미&nbsp;지급된&nbsp;광고비의&nbsp;전부&nbsp;또는&nbsp;일부에&nbsp;대한&nbsp;반환을&nbsp;청구할&nbsp;수&nbsp;있다.</span></li></ol><p></p><p><strong style="color: black;">제&nbsp;8&nbsp;조&nbsp;[콘텐츠&nbsp;게시의무]</strong></p><ol><li><span style="color: black;">“파트너”는&nbsp;광고물&nbsp;제작&nbsp;및&nbsp;게시&nbsp;과정에서&nbsp;“회사”가&nbsp;제공하는&nbsp;콘텐츠&nbsp;가이드라인</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">을&nbsp;준수하여야&nbsp;한다.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">“파트너”는&nbsp;“회사”가&nbsp;지정한&nbsp;일정&nbsp;내에&nbsp;콘텐츠를&nbsp;제작하여&nbsp;게시하여야&nbsp;하며,&nbsp;게시&nbsp;플랫폼,&nbsp;형식&nbsp;등은&nbsp;별첨&nbsp;“콘텐츠&nbsp;부속합의서”에&nbsp;따른다.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">“파트너”는&nbsp;콘텐츠&nbsp;게시&nbsp;전&nbsp;“회사”의&nbsp;사전&nbsp;검수를&nbsp;받아야&nbsp;한다.&nbsp;“회사”의</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">서면&nbsp;승인&nbsp;없이&nbsp;게시된&nbsp;콘텐츠는&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약에&nbsp;따른&nbsp;용역&nbsp;완료로&nbsp;인정되지&nbsp;않는다.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">단,&nbsp;제5항에&nbsp;따른&nbsp;승인&nbsp;간주에&nbsp;해당하는&nbsp;경우는&nbsp;제외한다.”</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">&quot;회사&quot;는&nbsp;&quot;파트너&quot;의&nbsp;영상&nbsp;초안&nbsp;최초&nbsp;제공일&nbsp;및&nbsp;수정안&nbsp;제공일부터&nbsp;3영업일&nbsp;이내에</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">승인&nbsp;또는&nbsp;수정&nbsp;사항을&nbsp;통보한다.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">“파트너”&nbsp;가&nbsp;“회사”의&nbsp;승인&nbsp;후&nbsp;정해진&nbsp;기한&nbsp;내에&nbsp;콘텐츠를&nbsp;게시하지&nbsp;않거나,&nbsp;사전&nbsp;협의없이&nbsp;게시를&nbsp;지연할&nbsp;경우&nbsp;광고주는&nbsp;계약금의&nbsp;일부&nbsp;또는&nbsp;전부를&nbsp;지급하지&nbsp;않을&nbsp;수&nbsp;있다.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">게시&nbsp;지연이&nbsp;7일을&nbsp;초과하는&nbsp;경우&nbsp;“회사”는&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약을&nbsp;해지할&nbsp;수&nbsp;있다.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">파트너는&nbsp;회사가&nbsp;요청한&nbsp;공개&nbsp;전&nbsp;영상의&nbsp;수정&nbsp;또는&nbsp;재편집&nbsp;요청을&nbsp;2회까지&nbsp;무상으로&nbsp;진행하며,&nbsp;</span><strong style="color: black; background-color: yellow;">3회부터는&nbsp;회사가&nbsp;파트너에게&nbsp;회당&nbsp;50,000원의&nbsp;추가&nbsp;비용을&nbsp;지급한다</strong><strong style="color: black;">.</strong></li><li><span style="color: black;">단,&nbsp;회사가&nbsp;제공한&nbsp;가이드라인을&nbsp;준수하지&nbsp;않은&nbsp;경우에는&nbsp;수정&nbsp;횟수와&nbsp;관계없이&nbsp;별도의&nbsp;추가&nbsp;비용&nbsp;없이&nbsp;재제작을&nbsp;요구할&nbsp;수&nbsp;있다.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">콘텐츠&nbsp;2차&nbsp;사용시&nbsp;회사는&nbsp;파트너의&nbsp;제작&nbsp;의도&nbsp;및&nbsp;영상&nbsp;내용을&nbsp;현저히&nbsp;변경하지&nbsp;않는&nbsp;범위&nbsp;내에서만&nbsp;사용할&nbsp;수&nbsp;있다.&nbsp;또한&nbsp;사용시&nbsp;&quot;제공:&nbsp;여행소희&quot;&nbsp;와&nbsp;같은&nbsp;출처&nbsp;표기를&nbsp;의무화한다.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">&quot;파트너&quot;는&nbsp;협의하여&nbsp;정한&nbsp;업로드&nbsp;예정일을&nbsp;기준으로&nbsp;광고물을&nbsp;게시하되,&nbsp;불가피한&nbsp;사유로&nbsp;게시가&nbsp;지연되는&nbsp;경우&nbsp;그&nbsp;사유를&nbsp;증빙&nbsp;가능한&nbsp;자료와&nbsp;함께&nbsp;회사에&nbsp;사전&nbsp;통보해야&nbsp;하며,&nbsp;&quot;회사&quot;의&nbsp;동의&nbsp;하에&nbsp;일정&nbsp;조정을&nbsp;할&nbsp;수&nbsp;있다.</span></li></ol><p></p><p><strong style="color: black;">제9조&nbsp;[양도&nbsp;및&nbsp;담보제공&nbsp;금지]&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><ol><li><span style="color: black;">“회사”와&nbsp;“파트너”는&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약에&nbsp;따른&nbsp;권리&nbsp;및&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약에&nbsp;따라&nbsp;발생하는&nbsp;각&nbsp;권리를&nbsp;상대방으로부터&nbsp;사전&nbsp;서면&nbsp;동의를&nbsp;받지&nbsp;아니하고&nbsp;제3자에게&nbsp;양도할&nbsp;수&nbsp;없으며,&nbsp;해당&nbsp;권리를&nbsp;제&nbsp;3자에게&nbsp;담보의&nbsp;목적으로&nbsp;제공할&nbsp;수&nbsp;없다.&nbsp;</span></li></ol><p></p><p><strong style="color: black;">제10조&nbsp;[손해배상]</strong></p><ol><li><span style="color: black;">&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약을&nbsp;이행하는&nbsp;과정에서&nbsp;각&nbsp;당사자가&nbsp;고의&nbsp;또는&nbsp;과실로&nbsp;상대방에게&nbsp;직∙간접적인&nbsp;손해를&nbsp;입힌&nbsp;경우&nbsp;각&nbsp;당사자는&nbsp;상대방이&nbsp;입은&nbsp;손해를&nbsp;배상하여야&nbsp;한다.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">각&nbsp;당사자는&nbsp;천재지변,&nbsp;국가비상사태,&nbsp;폭동,&nbsp;전쟁,&nbsp;테러,&nbsp;정부의&nbsp;조치,&nbsp;시민봉기,&nbsp;파업&nbsp;기타&nbsp;자기의&nbsp;지배범위&nbsp;밖의&nbsp;사유로&nbsp;인하여&nbsp;상대방&nbsp;및&nbsp;제3자에게&nbsp;발생시킨&nbsp;손해에&nbsp;대하여&nbsp;책임지지&nbsp;아니한다.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">계약&nbsp;체결&nbsp;이후&nbsp;“파트너&nbsp;”의&nbsp;귀책사유로&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약이&nbsp;해제&nbsp;또는&nbsp;해지되는&nbsp;경우,&nbsp;“회사”는&nbsp;지급&nbsp;예정&nbsp;금액의&nbsp;일부&nbsp;또는&nbsp;전부를&nbsp;지급하지&nbsp;않을&nbsp;수&nbsp;있다.</span></li></ol><p></p><p><strong style="color: black;">제1</strong><strong>1</strong><strong style="color: black;">조&nbsp;[관할&nbsp;법원]&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><ol><li><span style="color: black;">본&nbsp;계약내용에&nbsp;대한&nbsp;이의&nbsp;발생시&nbsp;“회사”와&nbsp;“파트너”는&nbsp;관계법령&nbsp;및&nbsp;상관례에&nbsp;따라&nbsp;상호&nbsp;협의하여&nbsp;호혜적&nbsp;차원에서&nbsp;결정하며,&nbsp;협의가&nbsp;이루어지지&nbsp;않아&nbsp;분쟁이&nbsp;발생하는&nbsp;경우&nbsp;전속적&nbsp;관할&nbsp;법원을&nbsp;대한민국&nbsp;서울중앙지방법원으로&nbsp;한다.</span></li></ol><p class="ql-align-justify"></p><p class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: black;">본&nbsp;계약을&nbsp;증명하기&nbsp;위하여&nbsp;계약&nbsp;당사자인&nbsp;“회사”와&nbsp;“파트너”는&nbsp;계약서를&nbsp;2부&nbsp;작성하여&nbsp;</span></p><p class="ql-align-center"><span style="color: black;">서명&nbsp;날인한&nbsp;후&nbsp;각&nbsp;1부씩&nbsp;보관한다.&nbsp;</span></p><p class="ql-align-center"></p><p></p><p class="ql-align-center"><strong style="background-color: yellow;">&nbsp;년&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;월&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;일</strong></p><p class="ql-align-center"></p><p class="ql-align-center"></p><table style="border: 1px solid #000;"><tbody><tr><td data-row="1" class="ql-align-center"><strong>&quot;갑&quot;</strong></td><td data-row="1"><strong>(주)밴스드</strong></td><td data-row="1"><strong>서울&nbsp;송파구&nbsp;백제고분로&nbsp;165&nbsp;3층</strong></td><td data-row="1"><strong>대표박&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;기&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;덕(인)</strong></td><td data-row="1" class="ql-align-center"><strong>&quot;을&quot;</strong></td><td data-row="1"></td><td data-row="1"><strong style="background-color: yellow;">사업자등록번호</strong></td><td data-row="1"><strong style="background-color: yellow;">대표&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(인)</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p></p><p class="ql-align-center"><strong>콘텐츠&nbsp;부속합의서</strong></p><p><strong style="color: black;">제1조&nbsp;[광고물&nbsp;게시]</strong></p><p></p><ol><li><span style="color: black;">“파트너”는&nbsp;“회사”와&nbsp;합의된&nbsp;내용에&nbsp;따라&nbsp;</span><strong style="background-color: yellow;">년&nbsp;월&nbsp;</strong><strong style="background-color: yellow; color: black;">일</strong><span style="color: black;">까지&nbsp;“</span>광고물<span style="color: black;">”</span>을&nbsp;지정된&nbsp;채널에<span style="color: black;">&nbsp;업로드&nbsp;한다.&nbsp;단,&nbsp;불가피한&nbsp;사유가&nbsp;있을&nbsp;경우,&nbsp;사전&nbsp;협의를&nbsp;통해&nbsp;기간을&nbsp;조정할&nbsp;수&nbsp;있다.</span></li><li><strong style="background-color: yellow;">“광고물”은&nbsp;&nbsp;로&nbsp;한다</strong><span style="background-color: yellow;">.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">“파트너”는&nbsp;“광고물”을&nbsp;채널에&nbsp;업로드&nbsp;한&nbsp;일자로&nbsp;부터&nbsp;</span><strong style="color: black; background-color: yellow;">6개월간&nbsp;게시된&nbsp;상태로&nbsp;유지</strong><span style="color: black;">하여야&nbsp;한다.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">“파트너”는&nbsp;“회사”가&nbsp;영리&nbsp;목적을&nbsp;위해&nbsp;“광고물”을&nbsp;사용할&nbsp;수&nbsp;있도록&nbsp;원본&nbsp;제공해야&nbsp;한다.</span></li></ol><p></p><p><strong style="color: black;">제2조&nbsp;[게시&nbsp;채널&nbsp;및&nbsp;계정&nbsp;정보]&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><ol><li><span style="color: black;">“파트너”는&nbsp;본&nbsp;계약에&nbsp;따른&nbsp;“광고물”을&nbsp;다음의&nbsp;계정을&nbsp;통해&nbsp;게시하여야&nbsp;한다.</span><ol><li><strong style="background-color: yellow;">•&nbsp;플랫폼명:&nbsp;</strong></li><li><strong style="background-color: yellow;">•&nbsp;계정명:&nbsp;</strong></li><li><strong style="background-color: yellow;">•&nbsp;계정&nbsp;URL:&nbsp;</strong></li></ol></li><li><span style="color: black;">“파트너”는&nbsp;사전&nbsp;서면&nbsp;동의&nbsp;없이&nbsp;계정명을&nbsp;변경하거나&nbsp;비공개&nbsp;전환하여서는&nbsp;아니&nbsp;된다.</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">“파트너”가&nbsp;게시&nbsp;채널&nbsp;또는&nbsp;계정을&nbsp;임의로&nbsp;변경·삭제하거나&nbsp;비활성화하여&nbsp;콘텐츠&nbsp;열람이</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">불가해진&nbsp;경우,&nbsp;광고주는&nbsp;해당&nbsp;콘텐츠의&nbsp;게시&nbsp;의무가&nbsp;미이행된&nbsp;것으로&nbsp;간주하고</span></li><li><span style="color: black;">대금의&nbsp;일부&nbsp;또는&nbsp;전부를&nbsp;환수할&nbsp;수&nbsp;있다.</span></li></ol><p></p><p><strong style="color: black;">제3조&nbsp;[2차&nbsp;활용협의]</strong></p><ol><li><span style="color: black;">“회사”는&nbsp;“파트너”가&nbsp;제작한&nbsp;“광고물”을&nbsp;본&nbsp;캠페인의&nbsp;목적&nbsp;및&nbsp;관련&nbsp;홍보&nbsp;활동을&nbsp;위해&nbsp;</span><strong style="color: black; background-color: yellow;">게시일로부터&nbsp;3개월간&nbsp;2차&nbsp;활용</strong><span style="color: black;">할&nbsp;수&nbsp;있다.</span></li><li>“2차&nbsp;활용”이라&nbsp;함은&nbsp;“광고물”을&nbsp;온라인&nbsp;광고,&nbsp;랜딩페이지,&nbsp;메타&nbsp;파트너십&nbsp;광고&nbsp;등에&nbsp;사용하는&nbsp;것을&nbsp;포함한다.&nbsp;단,&nbsp;광고물의&nbsp;본질적&nbsp;의미를&nbsp;훼손하는&nbsp;방식으로는&nbsp;사용할&nbsp;수&nbsp;없다.</li><li>“회사”가&nbsp;“2차&nbsp;활용”을&nbsp;갱신하고자&nbsp;할&nbsp;경우,&nbsp;기존&nbsp;“2차&nbsp;활용<strong>”&nbsp;</strong><strong style="background-color: yellow;">만료&nbsp;7일&nbsp;전까지&nbsp;“파트너”에게&nbsp;서면으로&nbsp;갱신&nbsp;의사를&nbsp;통보</strong>해야&nbsp;한다.</li><li>2차&nbsp;활용이&nbsp;갱신되는&nbsp;경우,&nbsp;그&nbsp;갱신&nbsp;기간은&nbsp;<strong style="background-color: yellow;">3개월</strong>로&nbsp;하며,&nbsp;“회사”는&nbsp;“파트너”에게&nbsp;</li><li>갱신에&nbsp;대한&nbsp;사용료로&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong style="background-color: yellow;">원</strong>을&nbsp;지급하기로&nbsp;한다.</li></ol>	\N	t	2026-02-02 17:00:09.400264	2026-02-08 07:21:50.862
\.


