normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;"></p><div><br></div><div>\n<meta charset="UTF-8"><div dir="auto" style="text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; -webkit-nbsp-mode: space; line-break: after-white-space;"><div>//<br><br>노마드 깅디 | Nomad Ging.D<br>👩🏽‍💻 17개국 한달살기한 디지털노마드<br>🌏 깅디의 지구살이<br>💗 nomad_ging.d<br>📧 nomadgingd@gmail.com<br><br></div></div>\n</div>\n<div><br><blockquote type="cite"><div>On Dec 24, 2025, at 8:32 AM, Martin김민철 &lt;martin@vanced.kr&gt; wrote:</div><br class="Apple-interchange-newline"><div><div dir="ltr">안녕하세요, 노마드 깅디님<div>밴스드 김민철 입니다.</div><div><br></div><div>구글폼 제출 확인하였습니다.</div><div>아래 계약서 및 추가 정리 내용 있어 전달드립니다.</div><div><div><br></div><div>1. 계약서</div><div>계약서 전달드립니다. 내용 확인하신 후 서명 후 회신 부탁드리겠습니다.</div><div>회신주시면 저희도 서명하여 재회신 드리겠습니다.</div><div><br></div><div>2. 2차 활용 갱신비용</div><div><div>2차활용 갱신비 확인하였으며, 말씀해주신 조건인 <b><u>45만원(6개월)</u></b>으로 다시 제안드립니다.</div></div><div>해당 내용은 전달드리는&nbsp;계약서에도 반영되어 있는 사항으로, 확인 부탁드리겠습니다.</div></div><div><br></div><div><div>3. 업로드일</div><div><div>이전에 말씀드린 것처럼, 업로드 일은 계약서 상에&nbsp;<b><u>1월 7일</u></b>로 일정을 전달드렸는데요,</div><div>이 부분은 협업 과정에서 조율 가능한 부분인 점 참고 부탁드립니다.</div></div><div><br></div><div>확인 부탁드리며, 12월 내 계약 완료가 필요한 상황이기에 가능하시다면 <b><u>금일까지 회신 주시면 감사하겠습니다!</u></b></div><div>또한 의논하실 부분 있으시면 편하게 말씀 부탁드립니다.</div><div><br></div><div>감사합니다.</div><div>김민철 드림</div><div><br></div></div></div><br><div class="gmail_quote gmail_quote_container"><div dir="ltr" class="gmail_attr">2025년 12월 24일 (수) AM 8:40, 노마드 깅디 &lt;<a href="mailto:nomadgingd@gmail.com">nomadgingd@gmail.com</a>&gt;님이 작성:<br></div><blockquote class="gmail_quote" style="margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex"><div><div style="margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;">안녕하세요, 김민철 매니저님.&nbsp;</div><div style="margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;">노마드 깅디입니다.</div><div style="margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;"><br></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;">업로드 일정 및 제안 주신 내용 확인했습니다.</div><div style="margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;">요청하신 구글폼 정보도 제출 완료했습니다.</div><div style="margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;"><br></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;"><b>[2차 활용 갱신 비용]</b></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;">다만, 문의하신 <b>2차 활용 갱신 비용</b>과 관련하여</div><div style="margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;">현재 진행 중인 계약 조건 자체가 이미 기존 단가보다 낮게 책정된 상황이라, 2차 활용 기간이 종료된 후 <b>추가 연장을 진행할 경우에는 기존 단가인 45만 원(6개월 기준)으로 진행하기를 희망</b>합니다. 추가 연장 단가에 대해서는 협의가 어려운 점 너른 양해 부탁드립니다.&nbsp;</div><div style="margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: &quot;Apple SD Gothic Neo&quot;; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-feature-settings: normal;">다만<span style="font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal">, 2</span>차<span style="font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal"> </span>활용<span style="font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal"> </span>기간을<span style="font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal"> <b>1</b></span><b>년으로</b><span style="font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal"><b> </b></span><b>확정하여</b><span style="font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal"><b> </b></span><b>계약하실</b><span style="font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal"><b> </b></span><b>경우</b><span style="font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal"><b>, </b></span><span style="text-decoration:underline"><b>릴스</b></span><span style="font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;text-decoration:underline"><b> PPL + 2</b></span><span style="text-decoration:underline"><b>차</b></span><span style="font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;text-decoration:underline"><b> </b></span><span style="text-decoration:underline"><b>활용</b></span><span style="font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-settings:normal;text-decoration:underline"><b>(1</b></span><span style="text-decoration:underline"><b>년</b></span><span style="font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;font-size-adjust:none;font-kerning:auto;font-variant-alternates:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-feature-setting